('46', '2024-09-02', 'We had a fun ride through the woods today. Nothing exciting happened.', '2024-10-18 00:46:09.188751+00', '2024-10-18 00:46:35.139155+00', '1', '4d8df2dd-17dd-4ab3-8618-8d567b8ced6b');